---
import { buttonVariants } from './ui/button';
import { cn } from '../lib/utils';
---

<footer class="relative mt-0 overflow-hidden border-t-2 border-ink bg-block-3 text-block-3-foreground">
  <div class="press-stripe h-2.5 w-full"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <span
      class="deco pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-10 right-0 text-[12rem] text-block-3-foreground/10 sm:text-[18rem]"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      &amp;
    </span>

    <div class="relative grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-5 gap-y-8">
      <div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="kicker text-secondary">The last word</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[clamp(2.2rem,9vw,4.5rem)]">
          Pick one. Call it.<br />
          <span class="italic text-secondary">The rest sorts itself out.</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="tel:+12098958080"
            class={cn(
              buttonVariants({ size: 'lg' }),
              'min-h-[54px] w-full border-2 border-ink px-6 font-sans text-[0.78rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] shadow-md transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-primary sm:w-auto',
            )}
          >
            Call Patterson Rec
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://pattersonwestleychamber.org/service-groups"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class={cn(
              buttonVariants({ variant: 'outline', size: 'lg' }),
              'min-h-[54px] w-full border-2 border-ink bg-secondary px-6 font-sans text-[0.78rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-secondary-foreground shadow-md transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-secondary sm:w-auto',
            )}
          >
            Every service club in town
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="col-span-12 border-t-2 border-block-3-foreground/40 pt-6 lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 lg:border-l-2 lg:border-t-0 lg:pl-6 lg:pt-0"
      >
        <p class="kicker text-block-3-foreground/70">Fine print, honestly</p>
        <div class="typeset mt-3 max-w-prose text-block-3-foreground/90">
          <p>
            Every phone number and link on this page belongs to the organization that runs
            the program, pulled from their own listings. Hours, dates and league seasons
            change, so the first call is always worth making.
          </p>
          <p>
            If a program has moved on, the Patterson Recreation office and the
            Patterson&ndash;Westley Chamber service groups page are the two places that
            always know what is currently running.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-2 border-t-2 border-block-3-foreground/40 pt-5"
    >
      <p class="kicker text-block-3-foreground/70">
        Made for somebody who brings people joy
      </p>
      <p class="kicker text-secondary">Patterson, California &middot; No. 01</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
